ud Provisioning","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The Grandstream GRP2613 HD IP Phone is a powerful carrier-grade business communication device designed for organizations that require reliable VoIP performance, exceptional audio quality, and simplified device management. Featuring support for 4 SIP accounts, 6 line keys, dual Gigabit network ports, integrated PoE, and enterprise-level security, the GRP2613 is an ideal choice for offices, call centers, reception desks, and corporate environments.</p><p>Built as part of Grandstream’s GRP series, the GRP2613 offers centralized provisioning and cloud-based management, making large-scale deployments easy and cost-effective. Its sleek design, crystal-clear HD voice, and advanced telephony features help improve productivity and communication efficiency across businesses of all sizes.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Supports up to 4 SIP accounts</li><li>6 multi-purpose line keys with dual-color LEDs</li><li>Large 2.8-inch color LCD display</li><li>24 virtual BLF keys for call monitoring and speed dialing</li><li>Dual Gigabit Ethernet ports</li><li>Integrated PoE (Power over Ethernet)</li><li>HD audio on handset and speakerphone</li><li>Noise Shield Technology for clearer calls</li><li>5-way audio conferencing</li><li>Enterprise-level security with secure boot and encrypted data storage</li><li>Compatible with Grandstream Device Management System (GDMS)</li><li>EHS support for compatible wireless headsets</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Dinstar C60SP Entry Level IP Phone with POE (Without Adapter)","href":"/dinstar-c60sp-entry-level-business-ip-phone","now":"3,400৳","old":"4,000৳","single":""},{"name":"SNOM C520 3-SIP PoE Black IP Conference Phone","href":"/snom-c520-3-sip-poe-black-ip-conference-phone","now":"33,000৳","old":"34,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Dinstar C60U Entry Level IP Phone with PoE and Adapter","href":"/dinstar-c60u-entry-level-ip-phone-with-poe-and-adapter","now":"","old":"","single":"3,700৳"},{"name":"DINSTAR C62UP Color Screen IP Phone with POE & Without Adapter","href":"/dinstar-c62up-color-screen-ip-phone-with-poe-and-without-adapter","now":"","old":"","single":"4,600৳"},{"name":"SNOM D305 4-SIP PoE Desk Black IP Phone Set without Adapter","href":"/snom-d305-4-sip-poe-desk-black-ip-phone-set-without-adapter","now":"","old":"","single":"4,290৳"},{"name":"SNOM D335 12-SIP PoE Desk Black IP Phone Set","href":"/snom-d335-12-sip-poe-desk-black-ip-phone-set","now":"","old":"","single":"13,800৳"},{"name":"SNOM D862 8-SIP PoE Desk Black IP Phone Set","href":"/snom-d862-8-sip-poe-desk-black-ip-phone-set","now":"","old":"","single":"22,900৳"},{"name":"SNOM D717 6-SIP PoE Desk Black IP Phone Set","href":"/snom-d717-6-sip-poe-desk-black-ip-phone-set","now":"","old":"","single":"9,500৳"},{"name":"SNOM D3 Expansion moduler for for SNOM D3xx Series","href":"/snom-d3-expansion-moduler-for-for-snom-d3xx-series","now":"","old":"","single":"9,400৳"},{"name":"Grandstream GRP2602P Basic HD IP Phone With Adapter","href":"/grandstream-grp2602p-basic-hd-ip-phone-with-adapter","now":"","old":"","single":"5,700৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/grandstream-grp2601-basic-hd-ip-phone-with-adapter","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/GRP2601/Grandstream%20GRP2601%20Basic%20HD%20IP%20Phone%20With%20Adapter%20P2-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Grandstream GRP2601 Basic HD IP Phone With Adapter","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Grandstream GRP2601 Basic HD IP Phone With Adapter","now":"","old":"","single":"